      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This change will also probably patch the clipping plane setting persisting between worlds if you went from a world that set it to a world that didn’t, which has been the vanilla workaround for a long long time. The one bug I could never report- for the fact that there was no guarantee that we would get an alternative.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
